{"id":"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","group":"92","path":"92/92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic.md","title":"The Book’s Eleven Fixed Arithmetic Axioms","display":"ax-smullyan-arithmetic — The Book’s Eleven Fixed Arithmetic Axioms","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic","aliases":["92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic"],"display":"ax-smullyan-arithmetic — The Book’s Eleven Fixed Arithmetic Axioms","source":"第 III 章 p. 29（PDF 46）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-smullyan-arithmetic — The Book’s Eleven Fixed Arithmetic Axioms"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 29（PDF 46）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1=v_1^E,v_2=v_2^E,0=\\nu_0^E,1=\\nu_1^E\">\\(v_1=v_1^E,v_2=v_2^E,0=\\nu_0^E,1=\\nu_1^E\\)</span>；所有算术和逻辑符号是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a> 的显示缩写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}\">\\(N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}\\)</span> 是下文指定的开放公理公式，不是外部自然数运算等式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_1&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1&#39;=v_2&#39;\\supset v_1=v_2),&amp;N_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E(0=v_1&#39;),\\\\\nN_3&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1+0)=v_1,&amp;N_4&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1+v_2&#39;)=(v_1+v_2)&#39;,\\\\\nN_5&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot0)=0,&amp;N_6&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot v_2&#39;)=((v_1\\cdot v_2)+v_1),\\\\\nN_7&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq0)\\leftrightarrow_E(v_1=0),\\\\\nN_8&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2&#39;)\\leftrightarrow_E((v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_1=v_2&#39;)),\\\\\nN_9&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_2\\leq v_1),\\\\\nN_{10}&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E0)=1,&amp;N_{11}&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E v_2&#39;)=((v_1\\mathsf E v_2)\\cdot v_1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_1&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1&#39;=v_2&#39;\\supset v_1=v_2),&amp;N_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E(0=v_1&#39;),\\\\\nN_3&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1+0)=v_1,&amp;N_4&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1+v_2&#39;)=(v_1+v_2)&#39;,\\\\\nN_5&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot0)=0,&amp;N_6&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot v_2&#39;)=((v_1\\cdot v_2)+v_1),\\\\\nN_7&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq0)\\leftrightarrow_E(v_1=0),\\\\\nN_8&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2&#39;)\\leftrightarrow_E((v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_1=v_2&#39;)),\\\\\nN_9&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_2\\leq v_1),\\\\\nN_{10}&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E0)=1,&amp;N_{11}&amp;\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E v_2&#39;)=((v_1\\mathsf E v_2)\\cdot v_1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 III 章 Group III 的每一个模式只有一条上述公式；全称闭包可由 Generalization 导出。第 IV 章 P.A. 删除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{10},N_{11}\">\\(N_{10},N_{11}\\)</span> 并限制整个文法，不能只在 P.E. 公理集中删掉两条而继续允许指数公式作归纳参数。</p>\n<p>本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_7,N_8,N_9\">\\(N_7,N_8,N_9\\)</span> 约束原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span>。它们和本地七公理 Robinson Q、六条基本 PA 公理的列表都不同。PDF 46 图像已核对，尤其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_7,N_8\">\\(N_7,N_8\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 不能依据 OCR 误读成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v_1=v_1^E,v_2=v_2^E,0=\\nu_0^E,1=\\nu_1^E$；所有算术和逻辑符号是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 的显示缩写。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v_1=v_1^E,v_2=v_2^E,0=\\nu_0^E,1=\\nu_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_1&\\coloneqq(v_1'=v_2'\\supset v_1=v_2),&N_2&\\coloneqq\\neg_E(0=v_1'),\\\\\nN_3&\\coloneqq(v_1+0)=v_1,&N_4&\\coloneqq(v_1+v_2')=(v_1+v_2)',\\\\\nN_5&\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot0)=0,&N_6&\\coloneqq(v_1\\cdot v_2')=((v_1\\cdot v_2)+v_1),\\\\\nN_7&\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq0)\\leftrightarrow_E(v_1=0),\\\\\nN_8&\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2')\\leftrightarrow_E((v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_1=v_2')),\\\\\nN_9&\\coloneqq(v_1\\leq v_2)\\lor_E(v_2\\leq v_1),\\\\\nN_{10}&\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E0)=1,&N_{11}&\\coloneqq(v_1\\mathsf E v_2')=((v_1\\mathsf E v_2)\\cdot v_1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N_{10},N_{11}","display":false},{"tex":"N_7,N_8,N_9","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"N_7,N_8","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false}],"bytes":1760,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。"},{"id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["40c0018b6d45300e"]}